WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.330
The United Nations has 193 member states.

2
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:07.090
Now picture a crowd at
a cultural festival,

3
00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.050
dancing to their own music.

4
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:10.970
Do they have a state of their own?

5
00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:13.550
Or do they live inside someone else's?

6
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.010
So, is a nation the same thing as a state?

7
00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.330
And if not, why do they so rarely match?

8
00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:24.590
In this mission, you'll test what a
place needs before the world counts it as

9
00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:25.030
a state.

10
00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:30.810
Then you'll sort real places by how their
peoples and their borders fit together.

11
00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:34.930
Your mission: find out whether a
nation is the same thing as a state,

12
00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:37.410
and why the two so rarely line up.
